mber of the year in which they have completed their 20th year of age."}], "confidence": "high", "follow_up_questions": ["What are the current AHV contribution rates?", "How do I register for AHV if I'm self-employed?", "Am I exempt from AHV contributions if I'm a student?"], "language": "en", "out_of_scope": false}

